# The base image every edge container uses, and when Fedora stops supporting it.
# test/edge-base-image.test.js (repo unit tests) fails 30 days before END_OF_LIFE,
# and if any Containerfile uses a different base, so the move to the next Fedora
# release happens before this one goes out of support. Containerfiles pin this
# tag to a digest (FROM IMAGE@sha256:...), the same in all of them; Dependabot's
# docker updates move the digest to the tag's latest patched build. The image
# comes from Docker Hub's official Fedora repository (built from Fedora's own
# releases) because Dependabot can't reach registry.fedoraproject.org.
# Fedora 45 released 2026-11-03; end of life 2027-12-08 (about 4 weeks after Fedora 47).
IMAGE=docker.io/library/fedora:45
END_OF_LIFE=2027-12-08
